    <main class="sidequests-info">
      <p class="kicker">Account controls</p>
      <h1>Delete your account</h1>
      <p class="lede">The fastest and most secure option is inside the app.</p>
      <ol>
        <li>Open Sidequests and sign in.</li>
        <li>Open <strong>Profile</strong>.</li>
        <li>Under <strong>Settings</strong>, choose <strong>Delete account</strong>.</li>
        <li>Review the permanent-deletion notice and confirm.</li>
      </ol>
      <p class="callout">Deletion removes your profile, Finds, private photos, rewards, friendships, invitations, reactions, shared-pack activity, and user-linked analytics from active systems. It cannot be undone.</p>
      <h2>Cannot access the app?</h2>
      <p>Email <a href="mailto:wongislandd@gmail.com?subject=Sidequests%20account%20deletion">wongislandd@gmail.com</a> from the address on your account. We will verify ownership before deleting it. Do not send a password or one-time code.</p>
      <h2>What may remain</h2>
      <p>Limited security, legal, backup, moderation, or identifier-free aggregate records may be retained where required and isolated from ordinary product use. See the <a href="/sidequests/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a> for details.</p>
    </main>
